  "interpretation": "100-image candidate at 4x CPU throttling/1.5 DPR reduces median renderer task work from 1.857s to 0.444s (76%). 612-image diagnostic at the same settings reduces median p95 frame interval from 42ms to 14.1ms; slow frames above 25ms fall from median 90 to 19. Unthrottled 100-image runs had no frames above 25ms in either variant, so an unthrottled stutter is not claimed.",
